<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 492 mln 12-pct bonds on June 19.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 492 mln 12-pct bonds on June 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland offers 492 million zlotys of 12 percent fixed bonds which mature on June 12, 2001, at an auction on June 19, the finance ministry said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The value date for the auction is July 5, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
